  "body": "Privately positioned up a wide driveway and only a short, level stroll from St Heliers Beach and Village, this beautifully secluded and peaceful family retreat offers space, privacy and an enviable lifestyle in one of the area's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated throughout and set on a substantial 886sqm freehold site, more or less, the weatherboard home spans over 300sqm and is designed for effortless family living. Light-filled living and dining areas flow seamlessly to expansive decks and level lawns, creating the perfect setting for entertaining, family gatherings and relaxed outdoor living. At the heart of the home is a stunning new kitchen with a large island bench, ideal for everyday living and entertaining alike.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is superbly configured with four bedrooms on the main level, including a generous primary suite with ensuite and a beautifully appointed new family bathroom. Downstairs, a fully self-contained studio offers exceptional flexibility for working from home, extended family, teenagers, guests or Airbnb income.\r\n\r\nElevated, sunny and wonderfully private, the property enjoys the reassurance of a blue-chip neighbourhood while being just moments from beaches, cafes, shops, transport links and an easy commute to the CBD.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are committed to their next move and want the property sold by Christmas. Opportunities to secure a family home of this scale, privacy and proximity to the beach are increasingly rare.",
